    "detailed_description": "Moxina is a First person Horror game. You will need to find keys to unlock some path and find ways to escape from moxina. Try to stay alive and don\u2019t lose your way in the forests. <br><br><strong>Story</strong><br>Moxina comes from the pronunciation of  M\u00f4-s\u00een-\u00e1 in chinese. It is a Taiwan Folklore as it is a child-like ghost that frequently appeared in the forest. It would hypnosis the targeted person and bring him to the forest. By toying with the victims, Moxina would feed the person with turd and insect by illusion. <br> <br>The story begins with the main character becoming the scapegoat of his neighbour Mr.Huang and it continues...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622600/extras/764f1710b5b9ce39a17cd8a5adb1f745.poster.avif?t=1621409040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622600/extras/764f1710b5b9ce39a17cd8a5adb1f745.webm?t=1621409040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622600/extras/764f1710b5b9ce39a17cd8a5adb1f745.mp4?t=1621409040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Graphics</strong><br>You can enable the effects (Bloom, Film Grain, Motion Blur, Ambient Occlusion)  in the setting. It would be highly recommended to turn on the Bloom and ambient occlusion to enhance the game experience. However, It will slow down the fps at the sametime. It's best only when it fits to your computer graphics setting.",
    "about_the_game": "Moxina is a First person Horror game. You will need to find keys to unlock some path and find ways to escape from moxina. Try to stay alive and don\u2019t lose your way in the forests. <br><br><strong>Story</strong><br>Moxina comes from the pronunciation of  M\u00f4-s\u00een-\u00e1 in chinese. It is a Taiwan Folklore as it is a child-like ghost that frequently appeared in the forest. It would hypnosis the targeted person and bring him to the forest. By toying with the victims, Moxina would feed the person with turd and insect by illusion. <br> <br>The story begins with the main character becoming the scapegoat of his neighbour Mr.Huang and it continues...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622600/extras/764f1710b5b9ce39a17cd8a5adb1f745.poster.avif?t=1621409040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622600/extras/764f1710b5b9ce39a17cd8a5adb1f745.webm?t=1621409040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622600/extras/764f1710b5b9ce39a17cd8a5adb1f745.mp4?t=1621409040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Graphics</strong><br>You can enable the effects (Bloom, Film Grain, Motion Blur, Ambient Occlusion)  in the setting. It would be highly recommended to turn on the Bloom and ambient occlusion to enhance the game experience. However, It will slow down the fps at the sametime. It's best only when it fits to your computer graphics setting.",
